{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02254",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 5.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.24,
      "end_seconds": 11.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.23,
      "end_seconds": 19.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "It's a lump in my left breast. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.77,
      "end_seconds": 23.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.68,
      "end_seconds": 28.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Well, I've had it for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.03,
      "end_seconds": 33.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Okay, is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.9,
      "end_seconds": 46.48,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "text": "It usually comes with the lump being there for a month. The lump being there for a month? That's been for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.92,
      "end_seconds": 47.89,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.11,
      "end_seconds": 69.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.55,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any nipple discharge or lump under the arm?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.21,
      "end_seconds": 73.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "None of those, you know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.89,
      "end_seconds": 78.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "Have you noticed skin dimpling or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.97,
      "end_seconds": 82.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.45,
      "end_seconds": 88.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.3,
      "end_seconds": 94.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Sorry, um, what was I saying, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.3,
      "end_seconds": 99.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.32,
      "end_seconds": 102.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.83,
      "end_seconds": 107.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "So, what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.4,
      "end_seconds": 113.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.74,
      "end_seconds": 117.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.72,
      "end_seconds": 122.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.4,
      "end_seconds": 125.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.59,
      "end_seconds": 134.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for about a year now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.14,
      "end_seconds": 136.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.92,
      "end_seconds": 149.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.37,
      "end_seconds": 163.1,
      "duration_seconds": 11.73,
      "text": "I mean, I take gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.43,
      "end_seconds": 166.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.89,
      "end_seconds": 170.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.09,
      "end_seconds": 181.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.6,
      "end_seconds": 194.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.86,
      "end_seconds": 216.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.2,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 73, blood pressure 108 over 80. And temperature 36.5, SpO2 98 percent on room air, respiratory rate 14."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.72,
      "end_seconds": 222.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Alright, I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.52,
      "end_seconds": 225.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.21,
      "end_seconds": 248.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.52,
      "text": "There is a firm, mobile, round lump about two centimetres in the upper outer part and no lumps under the arm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.85,
      "end_seconds": 254.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.9,
      "end_seconds": 282.92,
      "duration_seconds": 11.02,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, this is probably a breast lump needing triple assessment. I think a mammogram and ultrasound makes sense here, for breast lump."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.7,
      "end_seconds": 287.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Ah, when would that take place?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.55,
      "end_seconds": 309.61,
      "duration_seconds": 22.06,
      "text": "This does not mean cancer, but we do arrange a specialist one-stop clinic to be sure. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I'm going to send a referral to the breast clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.45,
      "end_seconds": 312.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.89,
      "end_seconds": 320.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "See me again after the clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.35,
      "end_seconds": 325.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Well, you know, good, I'll return then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.59,
      "end_seconds": 332.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "Alright, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.22,
      "end_seconds": 341.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Let me think, thank you, that's helpful."
    }
  ]
}